# A summon, not a swing: the orb floats and discharges on its own, so the
# magician uses Ice Strike the whole time. GMS's 196+5x% three times on six
# enemies, plus 70+5x% against non-bosses, which is a share of the character's
# damage, as GMS's "(additive)" says.
#
# 1.8s between discharges is the orb's own attack animation, fifteen frames of
# 120ms. It strikes on its own timing (`attackAfter`), like Phoenix, and read
# the same way Phoenix gives back the 1710ms it already uses.
name: "Thunder Sphere"
description:
  "Summon an orb of condensed lightning. The orb discharges a high-voltage "
  "current at nearby enemies to deal lightning-based damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_LIGHTNING
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE skill_order: 2 }
max_level: 20
max_enemies: 6
lines: 3
cast_interval_seconds: 1.8
base {
  skill_pct: 2.01
  normal_pct: 0.75
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.05
  normal_pct: 0.05
}
